        "original_id": "66be89cb-88eb-554d-8689-ff4bfc6df486",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robbie Keane, Hakan Şükür, Christian Vieri, Ronaldo, Olivia O'Toole\n- Organizations: Inter Milan, Republic of Ireland national team\n- Roles: Scorers, Captain\n- Topics: Injury recovery, International goals records, International retirement\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2000–01 Inter Milan season, Inter Milan relied on Hakan Şükür and Robbie Keane for scoring while waiting for Christian Vieri to recover and for Ronaldo to return.\n- From March 2006 until his international retirement in August 2016, Robbie Keane served as captain of the Republic of Ireland national team.\n- In September 2012, Robbie Keane equalled Olivia O'Toole's record of 54 international goals.",
